Terminals unused in grammar

    NOT


Grammar

    0 $accept: Prog $end

    1 Prog: DeclStarts DeclFoncts

    2 DeclStart: DeclVars
    3          | STRUCT IDENT '{' DeclVars '}' ';'

    4 DeclStarts: DeclStarts DeclStart
    5           | ε

    6 Type: TYPE
    7     | STRUCT IDENT

    8 DeclVars: Type Declarateurs ';'

    9 Declarateurs: Declarateurs ',' IDENT
   10             | IDENT

   11 DeclFoncts: DeclFoncts DeclFonct
   12           | DeclFonct

   13 DeclFonct: EnTeteFonct Corps

   14 EnTeteFonct: Type IDENT '(' Parametres ')'
   15            | VOID IDENT '(' Parametres ')'

   16 Parametres: VOID
   17           | ListTypVar
   18           | ε

   19 ListTypVar: ListTypVar ',' Type IDENT
   20           | Type IDENT

   21 Corps: '{' DeclStarts SuiteInstr '}'

   22 SuiteInstr: SuiteInstr Instr
   23           | Instr

   24 IdentAffect: IdentAffect DOT IDENT
   25            | IDENT

   26 Instr: IdentAffect '=' Exp ';'
   27      | IF '(' Exp ')' Instr
   28      | IF '(' Exp ')' Instr ELSE Instr
   29      | WHILE '(' Exp ')' Instr
   30      | IDENT '(' Arguments ')' ';'
   31      | RETURN Exp ';'
   32      | RETURN ';'
   33      | '{' SuiteInstr '}'
   34      | ';'

   35 Exp: Exp OR TB
   36    | TB

   37 TB: TB AND FB
   38   | FB

   39 FB: FB EQ M
   40   | M

   41 M: M ORDER E
   42  | E

   43 E: E ADDSUB T
   44  | T

   45 T: T DIVSTAR F
   46  | F

   47 F: ADDSUB F
   48  | '!' F
   49  | '(' Exp ')'
   50  | NUM
   51  | CHARACTER
   52  | IdentAffect
   53  | IDENT '(' Arguments ')'

   54 Arguments: ListExp
   55          | ε

   56 ListExp: ListExp ',' Exp
   57        | Exp


